# Debug/scratch dumps dropped at these specific spots during firmware
# bring-up (ride/IMU/sliding-zero CSV pulls, NVS backups, ride screenshots) --
# not build inputs. Scoped narrowly so tracked assets elsewhere (docs/,
# fab/, production/, firmware/partitions.csv) are unaffected.
/Screenshot_*.png
/firmware/*.bin
/firmware/*.csv
/firmware/src/*.csv
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.claude/settings.local.json
